  "details": "I was attempting to publish an update to one of my avatars last night, and there appeared to be some server issues such that it didn't propagate fully/something got rolled back and the avatar no longer exists on the server (I noted 404 errors on the VRC log)\nWhen attempting to upload an update now, the upload fails as well because the \"Cleaning Up Previous Versions\" step fails due to the fact that the file is already deleted/missing. Same error messages/symptoms as here (\"future proofing\" unrelated): https://ask.vrchat.com/t/can-no-longer-future-proof-avatar/2048/3",
